# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository; working trees get native
# endings via core.autocrlf / editor config. Added during the rearchitecture so
# line-ending churn never pollutes a refactor diff again.
* text=auto

# EF migration Designer files are `// <auto-generated />` — each one is a full snapshot
# of the whole model at that migration, not a diff, so a one-table change still writes
# ~3,000 lines nobody reviews. Collapse them in GitHub diffs (still versioned, still
# expandable). They are NOT optional files: each carries the [Migration(...)] attribute
# that makes EF discover the migration at all, so never delete one.
#
# ChartAttemptDbContextModelSnapshot.cs is deliberately NOT marked — its diff is the one
# generated output worth reading, because it shows exactly what the migration changed.
**/Migrations/*.Designer.cs linguist-generated=true

# Explicit binaries — never normalize.
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.traineddata binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
